@local/dsh-knowledge-base README · Personal Knowledge Base · Plugin and Desktop Client：> **2.4.3 can update directly.** Use [manual recovery instructions](docs/UPDATE-RECOVERY.md) only after an upgrade error; no preliminary transition package is required for the normal path.

[English](README.md) · [简体中文](README.zh-CN.md)

**Personal-Knowledge-Base is the single maintained repository for the DSH knowledge-base plugin and standalone desktop client.** They share a core, contracts and library service while retaining independent installations and versions.
